[web/changes/organizer-add-athlete-consent-20261005/05-screen-state-matrix.md#63A9]
1:# Screen State Matrix — organizer-add-athlete-consent-20261005
2:
3:| State | Candidate/Add UI | Participant row | Consent/ELO |
4:|---|---|---|---|
5:| S1 loaded, candidates available | rows/search/select | unchanged until submit | unrelated |
6:| S2 no friends/club candidates | empty state with source-specific explanation | unchanged | unrelated |
7:| S3 candidate request error | retry state; no stale success | unchanged | unrelated |
8:| S4 source relation revoked after fetch | submit receives conflict/forbidden; refetch | no partial participant | unchanged |
9:| S5 full division | clear capacity error | no partial participant/guest | unchanged |
10:| S6 direct guest, no email | one-time claim handoff credential | displays guest name; no account identity | ELO blocked while guest remains |
11:| S7 account-backed player added | participant displayed; payment by fee snapshot only | note at final position | consent pending is not shown to organizer |
12:| S8 player declines/has not consented | registration/add succeeds | status and presence normal | match not ranked until all roster consent |
13:| S9 player consents | self action becomes read-only | no roster mutation | future matches only |
14:| S10 claim after completed match | guest becomes account roster | contact/token cleared | historical match remains unscored |
15:| S11 participant/tournament removed/ended | no claim/reminder write | existing lifecycle controls govern | no reminder; no ELO replay |
16:| S12 fee snapshot zero | no payment control | presence remains independent | no ELO coupling |

### region 38 (read, ~996 tok)

[web/changes/organizer-add-athlete-consent-20261005/05-feature-impact-review.md#65DD]
1:# Feature Impact Review — organizer-add-athlete-consent-20261005
2:
3:Decision: **GO_WITH_CONDITIONS**.
4:
5:## Source of truth
6:
7:- Tournament/manager ownership: `TournamentAccessService.isManager`, same permission boundary as import.
8:- Friendship eligibility: `friendships.status='ACCEPTED' AND deletedAt IS NULL`; current `FriendshipsRepository.listActiveForUser` is insufficient by itself (`:77-91`).
9:- Club eligibility: tournament `communityId` and `community_members.status='JOINED'`.
10:- Fee: `TournamentPaymentRepository.resolveDivisionEntryFee`; save resulting `entryFeeAtRegistration` on creation. Snapshot field already exists.
11:- Presence: `tournament_participants.isPresent`, independent.
12:- Consent: `tournament_rosters.rankingConsentAt`, timestamp written only by that player's own session; no organizer state/control.
13:- ELO: enqueue, apply, replay and direct `updateMatchElo` must all verify ranked setting and every roster user consented before `completedAt`; `insertAdminEloHistory` excluded.
14:
15:## Phạm vi ảnh hưởng
16:
17:| Khu vực | Thay đổi |
18:|---|---|
19:| Backend tournaments | New candidate/add/direct/claim routes; reuse existing self-consent route; note and guest repository/DTOs; manager and source eligibility checks |
20:| Backend schema | `organizer_note` and `tournament_guest_rosters`; migration generated/reviewed, not applied to real DB |
21:| Backend rankings | Add completion timestamp + guest check to enqueue, guest check to existing apply/manual helper, ranked/guest replay guard; preserve admin history |
22:| Backend scheduler | active roster/tournament filter, safe HTML, cross-instance serialized dispatch, retry/counter assertions |
23:| Web | Add Athlete dialog beside spreadsheet import; friends/club/direct modes; note/presence/fee snapshot; player consent/claim UI |
24:| Flutter | Optional player consent and response model/client compatibility; no organizer UI unless existing consumer proves one exists |
25:| Excel/wildcard | unchanged |
26:
27:## Negative cases
28:
29:| Case | Required behavior |
30:|---|---|
31:| non-manager/unverified caller | 403; no candidate or write |
32:| friend pending/rejected/soft-deleted at write time | reject; no participant/roster row |
33:| club member removed or tournament not associated with club | reject |
34:| user already on active roster | conflict; no duplicate |
35:| guest direct entry without email | succeeds with one-time claim credential; no synthetic account/email |
36:| unverified/missing email account match | create guest, never link; claim requires verified account |
37:| expired/reused/invalid claim token or existing active roster | reject atomically; token cannot be replayed |
38:| empty roster/guest side, unranked tournament, missing/late consent | no ELO write or history |
39:| reminder row removed or tournament ended | no email/counter increment |
40:| mail failure | retry remains eligible; delivered-send counter unchanged |
41:
42:## Quyết định và điều kiện
43:
44:1. Separate endpoint and UI from Excel and wildcard.
45:2. Candidate GET is paginated and reveals only display name/avatar/source; commit rechecks relations.
46:3. A participant may include account-backed roster rows and guest rows. Any unclaimed guest row keeps ELO gate closed; claim migrates it into `tournament_rosters` with consent NULL.
47:4. Organizer-added rosters start with NULL consent; player may later opt in; participation/payment/presence are not blocked.
48:5. Keep existing 24h/72h reminder delay configuration unchanged; do not add intervals. Preserve the existing three-send cap and count only successful delivery.
49:6. Do not add organizer consent status, manual resend button, gender filter, or legal-compliance assertion.
50:7. Compliance owner review and strict validator are required before PR/release; neither is currently evidenced.

